                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>No official record of this conversation has been found. The information set forth
                    above is derived from Alanbrooke, pp. 329–330, which indicates that Hopkins gave
                    a detailed explanation of Roosevelt’s strategic views.</p>
